{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"story_kichi_set_1_story_1","storyGroup":"story_kichi_set_1","storySort":0,"storyDependence":null,"storyCanShow":0,"storyCode":null,"storyName":"好运相伴","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"被人做局的吉星即将被迫离开锻冶町，离别前她挨个拜访了邻居们。可没等她启程，设局的黑道先被找了麻烦。","storyCanEnter":0,"storyTxt":"obt/memory/story_kichi_1_1","avgTag":"幕间","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":0,"requiredStages":null,"characters":["吉星","冷静的黑道成员","黑道老大","疑惑的居民","不解的居民","疑惑的居民&不解的居民","？","热情的摊主","铃木大叔","伤心的摊主","生气的摊主","？？","？？？","黑道老大&害怕的黑道成员","森内"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EB/Avg_bg_64_g15_higashiroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$m_dia_street_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta3_181101/m_dia_street_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":6,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":7},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":8},{"type":"text","text":"不大的房间里，摆满了一排排的小钢珠机，而房间深处传来一阵阵按键音和游戏里的爆炸声。","id":9},{"type":"dialog","id":10},{"type":"playsound","key":"$doorknockquite","id":11},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":12},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":13},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1907_1#1$1","duration":"2","id":14},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":15},{"type":"charslot","id":16},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1897_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":17},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":18},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"来新客啦？","id":19,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DB/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1897_1#1$1","id":20},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"小钢珠机都开着呢，投币就能玩。饮品和零食都到前台自取——","id":21,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DB/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1907_1#1$1","id":22},{"type":"dialogue","name":"冷静的黑道成员","text":"你就是吉星？","id":23,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/05/Avg_avg_npc_1907_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1897_1#4$1","id":24},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"唔，不是来打小钢珠的？","id":25,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1907_1#1$1","id":26},{"type":"dialogue","name":"冷静的黑道成员","text":"我们听说你这边能接点别的生意，想请你帮个忙。","id":27,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/05/Avg_avg_npc_1907_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1897_1#5$1","id":28},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"唉，我能接什么别的生意，你们是不是找错人啦......","id":29,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6D/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1907_1#1$1","id":30},{"type":"dialogue","name":"冷静的黑道成员","text":"我们老大从萨尔贡新进了一批宝石，想请你过去看看......事成以后，这个数。","id":31,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/05/Avg_avg_npc_1907_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":32},{"type":"text","text":"黑道成员伸出手，比了一个数字。","id":33},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1897_1#10$1","id":34},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"（咽口水）这个数......？","id":35,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0F/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1907_1#1$1","id":36},{"type":"dialogue","name":"冷静的黑道成员","text":"千真万确。","id":37,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/05/Avg_avg_npc_1907_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":38},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":39},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":40},{"type":"charslot","id":41},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":42},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_bg_64_g6_gokudouoffice.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":43},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":44},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":45},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1906_1#1$1","id":46},{"type":"dialogue","name":"黑道老大","text":"吉星小姐，欢迎。","id":47,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_avg_npc_1906_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1906_1#1$1","id":48},{"type":"dialogue","name":"黑道老大","text":"我们山川会刚来御机不久，现在迫切需要一位本地人为我们开拓市场。","id":49,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_avg_npc_1906_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1897_1#2$1","id":50},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"好啦好啦，这些客套话都不用说了，东西在哪呢？","id":51,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6C/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":52},{"type":"text","text":"黑道老大摆摆手，一个沉甸甸的皮箱便出现在了两人面前的桌上。","id":53},{"type":"dialog","id":54},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_open_woodbox","id":55},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":56},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1897_1#6$1","id":57},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"这么多......？！","id":58,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B1/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1906_1#1$1","id":59},{"type":"dialogue","name":"黑道老大","text":"这些都是从我的一位朋友那收来的天然宝石，它们的大小和品质放眼全东国都是最顶级的。","id":60,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_avg_npc_1906_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1906_1#1$1","id":61},{"type":"dialogue","name":"黑道老大","text":"我花了不少钱才把它们收进囊中，但现在怎么处理它们反倒成了难题......","id":62,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_avg_npc_1906_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1906_1#1$1","id":63},{"type":"dialogue","name":"黑道老大","text":"这么多奇珍异宝在短时间内流进市场，除了会贬损它们的价值，还会引起有心之人的注意。","id":64,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_avg_npc_1906_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1906_1#1$1","id":65},{"type":"dialogue","name":"黑道老大","text":"我听闻吉星小姐擅长鉴定珠宝，而且在御机城人脉颇广，一定能为我找个好买家，卖个好价钱。","id":66,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_avg_npc_1906_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1897_1#10$1","id":67},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"等等，等等！我还没说要接你的单呢。","id":68,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0F/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":69},{"type":"text","text":"吉星随手从箱子里抓了一颗红色的宝石，将宝石对准屋顶的射灯，端详了许久。","id":70},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1897_1#2$1","id":71},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"乍一看倒是不错，可惜......","id":72,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6C/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1906_1#1$1","id":73},{"type":"dialogue","name":"黑道老大","text":"......可惜？","id":74,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_avg_npc_1906_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1897_1#1$1","id":75},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"萨尔贡虽然宝石品质高级，但他们那边大多都是小作坊手工制作，一年的产量少得可怜。","id":76,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DB/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1897_1#1$1","id":77},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"你的这一批货，乍一看品种不少，可加工方式太相似了。","id":78,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DB/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1897_1#1$1","id":79},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"切面太规则，工具都没有换过，说明做这批货的人经验还比较浅。","id":80,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DB/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1897_1#4$1","id":81},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"还有这里的边角也是，痕迹太新，好一点的情况是出厂年份比较近，差一点的情况......可能原料都不是天然的。","id":82,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1906_1#1$1","id":83},{"type":"dialogue","name":"黑道老大","text":"不可能......绝对不可能！","id":84,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_avg_npc_1906_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1906_1#1$1","id":85},{"type":"dialogue","name":"黑道老大","text":"这些都是我看着他们从拍卖行的仓库里一件件拿出来，我一件件挑好的。","id":86,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_avg_npc_1906_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1897_1#4$1","id":87},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"唉，如果你还是不信的话......那就看这颗。","id":88,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1897_1#1$1","id":89},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"在法尔贾万达巴德博物馆里，有一颗和它一模一样的蓝宝石，名字叫“璀璨之泪”，上面同样嵌了一颗泪形黄金。","id":90,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DB/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1897_1#1$1","id":91},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"萨尔贡的国宝，可能经过正规的拍卖行，流转到你我的手里吗？","id":92,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DB/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1897_1#1$1","id":93},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"......话不用我再多说了吧？","id":94,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DB/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1906_1#1$1","id":95},{"type":"dialogue","name":"黑道老大","text":"你的意思是，我的这些宝贝......都是假的？","id":96,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_avg_npc_1906_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1897_1#1$1","id":97},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"假的，你换谁鉴定都是假的。","id":98,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DB/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1906_1#1$1","id":99},{"type":"dialogue","name":"黑道老大","text":"......可这些宝贝都经过了专家认证。","id":100,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_avg_npc_1906_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1897_1#2$1","id":101},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"什么......？","id":102,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6C/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1906_1#1$1","id":103},{"type":"dialogue","name":"黑道老大","text":"这些宝贝都是一位议员大人转手给我的，他的大名在东国收藏界无人不知。","id":104,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_avg_npc_1906_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1897_1#6$1","id":105},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"你说的是藤堂——","id":106,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B1/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1906_1#1$1","id":107},{"type":"dialogue","name":"黑道老大","text":"不能说。","id":108,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_avg_npc_1906_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1906_1#1$1","id":109},{"type":"dialogue","name":"黑道老大","text":"那位大人把这些珠宝交给我前，特地把它们送去了鉴定机构，这些都是专家给出的鉴定结果。","id":110,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_avg_npc_1906_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":111},{"type":"charslot","id":112},{"type":"text","text":"黑道老大将一本厚重的文件放在茶几上，上面印满了各种机构的标志。","id":113},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1897_1#2$1","id":114},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"（小声）*东国粗口*，这上面可没一个惹得起啊......","id":115,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6C/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1906_1#1$1","id":116},{"type":"dialogue","name":"黑道老大","text":"如你所见，没有一个专家说我的宝贝是假的，除了你，吉星小姐。","id":117,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_avg_npc_1906_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1897_1#2$1","id":118},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"......既然已经找过了更权威的机构，干嘛还要找我？","id":119,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6C/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1906_1#1$1","id":120},{"type":"dialogue","name":"黑道老大","text":"在一开始我就和你明说了，吉星小姐，我希望你能帮我找到一些好的买家。","id":121,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_avg_npc_1906_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1906_1#1$1","id":122},{"type":"dialogue","name":"黑道老大","text":"我已经事先找人了解过了，你的奶奶在御机的珠宝界久负盛名，而你接手了她的事业。","id":123,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_avg_npc_1906_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1906_1#1$1","id":124},{"type":"dialogue","name":"黑道老大","text":"有你的帮忙，这批货不难出手。至于酬劳，你放心，只多不少。","id":125,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_avg_npc_1906_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1897_1#1$1","id":126},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"哈哈......你在说笑呢，我就是一个替人看小钢珠店的小妹，哪有那么大能耐？","id":127,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DB/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1906_1#1$1","id":128},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":129},{"type":"dialogue","name":"黑道老大","text":"......你还是觉得我的货假，不想帮我。","id":130,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_avg_npc_1906_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1897_1#5$1","id":131},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"哪有的事？我可从来没有说过你的宝贝假哦！","id":132,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6D/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1906_1#1$1","id":133},{"type":"dialogue","name":"黑道老大","text":"（挥挥手）","id":134,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_avg_npc_1906_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1907_1#1$1","id":135},{"type":"dialogue","name":"冷静的黑道成员","text":"嗯，老大，我已经全部录下来了。","id":136,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/05/Avg_avg_npc_1907_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1897_1#6$1","id":137},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"15","ystrength":"15","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":138},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"......你算计我？！","id":139,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B1/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1906_1#1$1","id":140},{"type":"dialogue","name":"黑道老大","text":"只是诚信交易的基本操作而已。","id":141,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_avg_npc_1906_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1906_1#1$1","id":142},{"type":"dialogue","name":"黑道老大","text":"吉星小姐，我完全信任你的能力。","id":143,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_avg_npc_1906_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1906_1#1$1","id":144},{"type":"dialogue","name":"黑道老大","text":"我从议员那收过来这些货，几乎花掉了全部的家当。如果你判断这些东西都是假的，我会拿着你的报告去跟他算账......","id":145,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_avg_npc_1906_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1906_1#1$1","id":146},{"type":"dialogue","name":"黑道老大","text":"如果这批货没有问题......你就必须帮我把这批价值几亿的珠宝全部卖出去。","id":147,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_avg_npc_1906_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":148},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":149},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":150},{"type":"charslot","id":151},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":152},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EC/Avg_bg_64_g4_kajistreet_dusk.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":153},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":154},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$drift_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_drift_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":155,"musicid":1},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":156},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1908_1#1$1","id":157},{"type":"dialogue","name":"疑惑的居民","text":"你知道吉星去哪了吗？","id":158,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/78/Avg_avg_npc_1908_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1908_1#1$1","id":159},{"type":"dialogue","name":"疑惑的居民","text":"小钢珠店今天一直没开门，门口也没有贴通知......","id":160,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/78/Avg_avg_npc_1908_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1911_1#1$1","id":161},{"type":"dialogue","name":"不解的居民","text":"应该是突然有什么事吧？这孩子很忙的啦。","id":162,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F7/Avg_avg_npc_1911_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1908_1#1$1","id":163},{"type":"dialogue","name":"疑惑的居民","text":"唉，可惜今天没法玩便宜的小钢珠了。习惯她家的价格以后，都不愿意去其他家了......","id":164,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/78/Avg_avg_npc_1908_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":165},{"type":"charslot","id":166},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1897_1#10$1","duration":"2","id":167},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":168},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1908_1#1$1","id":169},{"type":"dialogue","name":"疑惑的居民","text":"吉星，你回来啦？！","id":170,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/78/Avg_avg_npc_1908_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1897_1#10$1","id":171},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"呜......","id":172,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0F/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1911_1#1$1","id":173},{"type":"dialogue","name":"不解的居民","text":"你怎么垂头丧气的，遇到什么事情了？","id":174,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F7/Avg_avg_npc_1911_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1897_1#10$1","id":175},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"嗯......都怪我没什么戒心，早知道就不沾这种事了！","id":176,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0F/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1897_1#8$1","id":177},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"谁知道会碰到这种不能惹的人......现在要么帮别人卖几个亿的假货，要么倒欠人家几个亿！","id":178,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CF/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":179},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1911_1#1$1","id":180},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1908_1#1$1","id":181},{"type":"dialogue","name":"疑惑的居民&不解的居民","text":"几、几个亿？！","id":182,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/78/Avg_avg_npc_1908_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":183},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1897_1#4$1","id":184},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"把我的小店......不，把我整个人卖了都值不了这么多钱啊！","id":185,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":186},{"type":"text","text":"吉星敲着自己的脑袋，摇摇晃晃地朝自家小店走去，只留下惊诧的路人。","id":187},{"type":"text","text":"夜色将近，小店的“吉星”招牌不规则地闪着，即使下一秒突然熄灭也不奇怪。","id":188},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1897_1#10$1","id":189},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"吉星，吉星......你怎么这么倒霉啊？","id":190,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0F/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":191},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":192},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":193},{"type":"charslot","id":194},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":195},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_bg_64_g6_gokudouoffice.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":196},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":197},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":198},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1907_1#1$1","id":199},{"type":"dialogue","name":"冷静的黑道成员","text":"老大，她回家了。","id":200,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/05/Avg_avg_npc_1907_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1906_1#1$1","id":201},{"type":"dialogue","name":"黑道老大","text":"她有什么动作？","id":202,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_avg_npc_1906_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1907_1#1$1","id":203},{"type":"dialogue","name":"冷静的黑道成员","text":"没有......就是抱着抱枕哭了一阵，然后在地板上不停打滚，现在在打电子游戏。","id":204,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/05/Avg_avg_npc_1907_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1906_1#1$1","id":205},{"type":"dialogue","name":"黑道老大","text":"......她没有跟谁打电话？","id":206,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_avg_npc_1906_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1907_1#1$1","id":207},{"type":"dialogue","name":"冷静的黑道成员","text":"没。","id":208,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/05/Avg_avg_npc_1907_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1907_1#1$1","id":209},{"type":"dialogue","name":"冷静的黑道成员","text":"老大，我们会不会盯错目标了。她家里除了游戏机什么都没有，看着也不像是有钱人......","id":210,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/05/Avg_avg_npc_1907_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1906_1#1$1","id":211},{"type":"dialogue","name":"黑道老大","text":"不可能！","id":212,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_avg_npc_1906_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1906_1#1$1","id":213},{"type":"dialogue","name":"黑道老大","text":"她奶奶当年靠卖假珠宝赚了那么多钱，怎么可能不留一点给她的孙女？","id":214,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_avg_npc_1906_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1906_1#1$1","id":215},{"type":"dialogue","name":"黑道老大","text":"之前踩点的时候，她就是现在这副三天打鳞两天晒网的样子，说明这家伙根本不缺钱。","id":216,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_avg_npc_1906_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1906_1#1$1","id":217},{"type":"dialogue","name":"黑道老大","text":"这种到嘴边的肉，我怎么可能让给别人？","id":218,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_avg_npc_1906_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":219},{"type":"charslot","id":220},{"type":"playsound","key":"$phone","id":221},{"type":"delay","time":"5","id":222},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1907_1#1$1","id":223},{"type":"dialogue","name":"冷静的黑道成员","text":"喂......什么？","id":224,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/05/Avg_avg_npc_1907_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1907_1#1$1","id":225},{"type":"dialogue","name":"冷静的黑道成员","text":"......好，我知道了。","id":226,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/05/Avg_avg_npc_1907_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":227},{"type":"playsound","key":"$transmission","volume":"0.6","id":228},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":229},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1907_1#1$1","id":230},{"type":"dialogue","name":"冷静的黑道成员","text":"老大，眼线说，她正在收拾东西！","id":231,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/05/Avg_avg_npc_1907_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1906_1#1$1","id":232},{"type":"dialogue","name":"黑道老大","text":"哼，我就知道......盯紧点，别让她跑了。","id":233,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_avg_npc_1906_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":234},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":235},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":236},{"type":"charslot","id":237},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":238},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_bg_64_g5_kajistreet_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":239},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":240},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":241},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_758_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","id":242},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？","id":243,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8C/Avg_avg_npc_758_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_758_1#1$1","id":244},{"type":"dialogue","name":"热情的摊主","text":"日用品、饰品、小零食，所有商品通通五折——","id":245,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8C/Avg_avg_npc_758_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":246},{"type":"charslot","id":247},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":248},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1897_1#1$1","duration":"2","id":249},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":250},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_758_1#1$1","id":251},{"type":"dialogue","name":"热情的摊主","text":"哟，吉星，你怎么背着这么大一个袋子？","id":252,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8C/Avg_avg_npc_758_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1897_1#9$1","id":253},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"铃木大叔，我是来道别的。我可能......得离开锻冶町一段时间了。","id":254,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CD/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_758_1#1$1","id":255},{"type":"dialogue","name":"铃木大叔","text":"啊？发生什么事了，怎么突然就要离开？","id":256,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8C/Avg_avg_npc_758_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1897_1#1$1","id":257},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"没、没发生什么，就是......就是工作原因，我以后就不在这里干了。","id":258,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DB/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_758_1#1$1","id":259},{"type":"dialogue","name":"铃木大叔","text":"什么工作这么着急......吉星，你不会是遇到什么麻烦了吧？","id":260,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8C/Avg_avg_npc_758_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_758_1#1$1","id":261},{"type":"dialogue","name":"铃木大叔","text":"有什么事就直说，咱们都是多少年的街坊邻居了，能帮一定帮你。","id":262,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8C/Avg_avg_npc_758_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1897_1#10$1","id":263},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"（东张西望）怎么说呢......的确是个不小的麻烦，但这些都该是我一个人承担的，我也不想把大家都拖下水。","id":264,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0F/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":265},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":266},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":267},{"type":"charslot","id":268},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":269},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":270},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":271},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1897_1#2$1","id":272},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"总之......事情就是这样。","id":273,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6C/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_759_1#1$1","id":274},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伤心的摊主","text":"小吉星，我真的很难过......","id":275,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/23/Avg_avg_npc_759_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_759_1#1$1","id":276},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伤心的摊主","text":"你奶奶生前对我那么好，我也一直把你当成我的亲妹妹，你怎么说走就走了呢？","id":277,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/23/Avg_avg_npc_759_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_759_1#1$1","id":278},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伤心的摊主","text":"还有你的小店该怎么办......？","id":279,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/23/Avg_avg_npc_759_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1897_1#2$1","id":280},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"小钢珠店是铁斋老爷子的，他肯定能找到下一个看店的人。","id":281,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6C/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1897_1#2$1","id":282},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"这个门面的位置很好，即使我的店在二楼也不愁租不出去，之后说不定会开个音像店或者拉面店......","id":283,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6C/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_759_1#1$1","id":284},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伤心的摊主","text":"（抽泣）小吉星，你不要再说了......我不想任何人在这里开新店，我只想要你能一直在锻冶町。","id":285,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/23/Avg_avg_npc_759_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1897_1#9$1","id":286},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"可、可......姐姐，我必须得走了。","id":287,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CD/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":288},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":289},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":290},{"type":"charslot","id":291},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":292},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":293},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":294},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1908_1#1$1","id":295},{"type":"dialogue","name":"生气的摊主","text":"咋就突然要走了呢？我联系一下大伙，至少给你办一个欢送会再走吧？","id":296,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/78/Avg_avg_npc_1908_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1897_1#10$1","id":297},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"（东张西望）不、不用了！我明天就要走了，就不劳烦各位邻居了。","id":298,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0F/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":299},{"type":"dialog","id":300},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1907_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":301},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":302},{"type":"dialogue","name":"冷静的黑道成员","text":"......","id":303,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/05/Avg_avg_npc_1907_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":304},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":305},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":306},{"type":"charslot","id":307},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":308},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_bg_64_g6_gokudouoffice.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":309},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":310},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":311},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1907_1#1$1","id":312},{"type":"dialogue","name":"冷静的黑道成员","text":"吉星今天一整天都在外面走访，挨家挨户地和附近的居民道别。","id":313,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/05/Avg_avg_npc_1907_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1907_1#1$1","id":314},{"type":"dialogue","name":"冷静的黑道成员","text":"她从一开始就注意到了我，所以鉴定和欠债的事也没有泄露。","id":315,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/05/Avg_avg_npc_1907_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1906_1#1$1","id":316},{"type":"dialogue","name":"黑道老大","text":"呵，我料定她耍不了花招。","id":317,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_avg_npc_1906_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1907_1#1$1","id":318},{"type":"dialogue","name":"冷静的黑道成员","text":"说不定......她是在给自己后面借钱做铺垫。","id":319,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/05/Avg_avg_npc_1907_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1906_1#1$1","id":320},{"type":"dialogue","name":"黑道老大","text":"一条破街上的小商小贩，能有多大能耐？","id":321,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_avg_npc_1906_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1906_1#1$1","id":322},{"type":"dialogue","name":"黑道老大","text":"我倒要看看她究竟能藏到什么时候......","id":323,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_avg_npc_1906_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":324},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":325},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":326},{"type":"charslot","id":327},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":328},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/60/Avg_bg_64_g10_higashigarden_r.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":329},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":330},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":331},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_758_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","id":332},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？","text":"......今天不打牌了，没心情打。","id":333,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8C/Avg_avg_npc_758_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_758_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","id":334},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？","text":"吉星的事，你们都知道了？","id":335,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8C/Avg_avg_npc_758_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_759_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","id":336},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？","text":"小姑娘一早上就跑过来告别，一脸苦兮兮的，谁看着不心疼......","id":337,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/23/Avg_avg_npc_759_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_758_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","id":338},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？","text":"查得到后面是谁？","id":339,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8C/Avg_avg_npc_758_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1908_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","id":340},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"这两天街上有几个生面孔，一直偷摸跟在吉星后面，看举止像是道上的。","id":341,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/78/Avg_avg_npc_1908_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1908_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","id":342},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"收摊的时候，我叫高桥和渡边跟过去了，先探探对方是什么底细。","id":343,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/78/Avg_avg_npc_1908_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_758_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","id":344},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？","text":"行，我正好去联系一些老伙计。","id":345,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8C/Avg_avg_npc_758_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1908_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","id":346},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"啊，你准备出手了？","id":347,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/78/Avg_avg_npc_1908_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1908_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","id":348},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"你忘了？咱们当年可是跟铁斋立过誓的，金盆洗手，换在这条街安度余生——","id":349,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/78/Avg_avg_npc_1908_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_759_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","id":350},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？","text":"铁斋现在跟他那个二把手斗来斗去，就算他有心帮那小姑娘，也未必能抽得开身。","id":351,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/23/Avg_avg_npc_759_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_759_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","id":352},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？","text":"况且，自家孩子受了委屈，这要是都不出手，咱们以后还有脸坐在一起打牌吗？","id":353,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/23/Avg_avg_npc_759_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1908_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","id":354},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"......倒也是。要怪就怪这十几年太安逸，年轻时的那点冲劲都磨没了......","id":355,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/78/Avg_avg_npc_1908_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_758_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","id":356},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？","text":"别插科打诨了，该干活了。","id":357,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8C/Avg_avg_npc_758_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":358},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":359},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":360},{"type":"charslot","id":361},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":362},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EB/Avg_bg_64_g15_higashiroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":363},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":364},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":365},{"type":"charslot","id":366},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"所以——你现在不还是在这里继续开店，最后到底是怎么解决的呢？","id":367},{"type":"dialog","id":368},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4199_makiri_1#1$1","duration":"2","id":369},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":370},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1897_1#1$1","id":371},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"哎呀，说起来也是奇怪，我当时大包小包收拾好，就准备最后跟铁斋老爷子道个别，结果临走的时候，硬是被那几个黑道堵在了门口......","id":372,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DB/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":373},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":374},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":375},{"type":"charslot","id":376},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":377},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EC/Avg_bg_64_g4_kajistreet_dusk.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":378},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","keep":"true","amount":"1","fadetime":"0","id":379},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":380},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":381},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1906_1#1$1","id":382},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1907_1#1$1","id":383},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"15","ystrength":"15","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":384},{"type":"dialogue","name":"黑道老大&害怕的黑道成员","text":"（深鞠躬）真的——非常抱歉！","id":385,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/05/Avg_avg_npc_1907_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":386},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1897_1#6$1","id":387},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"啊？","id":388,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B1/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1906_1#1$1","id":389},{"type":"dialogue","name":"黑道老大","text":"（保持鞠躬）吉星小姐，我们不清楚您和谏崎的松竹会还有联系！实在冒犯了！","id":390,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_avg_npc_1906_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1897_1#6$1","id":391},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"啊？那个又是啥？","id":392,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B1/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1906_1#1$1","id":393},{"type":"dialogue","name":"黑道老大","text":"我们已经深刻认识到自己的错误了，还请您宽宏大量，放我们一马！","id":394,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_avg_npc_1906_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1906_1#1$1","id":395},{"type":"dialogue","name":"黑道老大","text":"这些是我们的一点心意，还请吉星大人收下！","id":396,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_avg_npc_1906_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1906_1#1$1","id":397},{"type":"dialogue","name":"黑道老大","text":"（更深地鞠躬）真的——非常抱歉！","id":398,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_avg_npc_1906_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":399},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":400},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":401},{"type":"charslot","id":402},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":403},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EB/Avg_bg_64_g15_higashiroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":404},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","keep":"true","amount":"0","fadetime":"0","id":405},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":406},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_calm_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":407,"musicid":2},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":408},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1897_1#1$1","id":409},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"我最后不仅一分钱没有赔，还倒赚了不少鉴定珠宝的钱......哼哼，很厉害吧？","id":410,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DB/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4199_makiri_1#1$1","id":411},{"type":"dialogue","name":"森内","text":"的确是一段跌宕起伏的故事啊......你要是想知道是谁帮你摆平的，我可以帮你打听打听？","id":412,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_4199_makiri_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1897_1#1$1","id":413},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"不用啦不用啦，这种事情搞得那么清楚干什么嘛~","id":414,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DB/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1897_1#4$1","id":415},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"帮我的好心人一直没有出现，说明他就是不想露面啊。","id":416,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1897_1#1$1","id":417},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"而且，说不定真的是因为我运气比较好——你看，刚才在神社求的签，“大吉”欸！","id":418,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DB/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4199_makiri_1#13$1","id":419},{"type":"dialogue","name":"森内","text":"呼——你心态这么好，倒是也没什么问题。","id":420,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A2/Avg_avg_4199_makiri_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1897_1#1$1","id":421},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"只要日子还能过得下去，怎么过不是过呢。我现在就想着，要是能在这开一辈子店，那该有多好啊！","id":422,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DB/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4199_makiri_1#3$1","id":423},{"type":"dialogue","name":"森内","text":"唉，我看着你也只有羡慕的份，我可没有家人留下的巨额遗产......","id":424,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E8/Avg_avg_4199_makiri_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1897_1#6$1","id":425},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"谁说我有一大笔遗产了？","id":426,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B1/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1897_1#1$1","id":427},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"奶奶一直和我说的是“人生苦短，及时行乐”。每次她赚到钱以后，都带着我去各种地方旅游了。","id":428,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DB/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1897_1#1$1","id":429},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"这么想想，好像每次我们回来的时候，都是连饭都吃不起......","id":430,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DB/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4199_makiri_1#4$1","id":431},{"type":"dialogue","name":"森内","text":"（擦汗）唉，我现在知道你的个性是继承谁的了，还好你们当初没有退掉这个店面......","id":432,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/00/Avg_avg_4199_makiri_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1897_1#1$1","id":433},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"这个店面怎么可能退掉嘛，这里是我们唯一的家，真退掉了就没地方住啦！这点我还是很清楚的！","id":434,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DB/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":435},{"type":"charslot","id":436},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_windchime_JP","volume":"0.7","id":437},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":438},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1897_1#11$1","id":439},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉星","text":"来客了来客了。小钢珠机都开着，投币就能玩。饮品和零食都到前台自取——","id":440,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EB/Avg_avg_npc_1897_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":441},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":442},{"type":"dialog","id":443},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":444},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":445},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":446},{"type":"character","id":447},{"type":"image","id":448}],"characters":["吉星","冷静的黑道成员","黑道老大","疑惑的居民","不解的居民","疑惑的居民&不解的居民","？","热情的摊主","铃木大叔","伤心的摊主","生气的摊主","？？","？？？","黑道老大&害怕的黑道成员","森内"]}